NOTE ON UPSTREAM CODE / 上游代码说明

The MIT license above covers the original code authored for this repository:
the port layer (port/), the UWP harness (harness/), and the tooling (tools/).

This project builds against upstream WebKit / WebCore / JavaScriptCore / WTF
(webkitgtk-2.52.4), which is NOT included in this repository and remains under
its own licenses (primarily LGPL-2.1 and BSD-2-Clause). Bundled third-party
runtime dependencies (Cairo, ICU, libcurl, FreeType, HarfBuzz, ANGLE, etc.)
likewise retain their respective upstream licenses.

本仓库自有代码(port/、harness/、tools/)以 MIT 授权。其所链接的上游
WebKit/WebCore/JSC/WTF 及第三方运行库不包含在本仓库内,各自保留其原始授权
(主要为 LGPL-2.1 / BSD)。
